OL,3,ATwo men arrested after boy injured in
OL,4,Asword attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fteenager was injured in an attack
OL,8,Finvolving a sword near two schools in a
OL,9,FGloucester suburb.
OL,11,FSt Peter's High School and Willow
OL,12,FPrimary Academy, in Tuffley, were put
OL,13,Finto lockdown after the incident at
OL,14,F08:50 GMT on Friday. Police said a
OL,15,F17-year-old suffered a wound "believed
OL,16,Fto have been caused by the sword".
OL,18,FA 19-year-old man from Gloucester was
OL,19,Farrested overnight on suspicion of
OL,20,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm
OL,21,Fand affray.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
